{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20082",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 4.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 9.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Hmm, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.77,
      "end_seconds": 14.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.05,
      "end_seconds": 17.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.22,
      "end_seconds": 23.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "A couple of times, you know, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.66,
      "end_seconds": 27.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 30.13,
      "end_seconds": 39.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "It's red, cracked skin on my hands, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.79,
      "end_seconds": 46.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.71,
      "end_seconds": 50.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.21,
      "end_seconds": 63.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "So, um, it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.22,
      "end_seconds": 67.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.36,
      "end_seconds": 96.02,
      "duration_seconds": 27.66,
      "text": "Let me think, for my cholesterol, I believe. My husband sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning. Oh, I take moisturiser, several times a day. Oh, I was on lansoprazole before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.56,
      "end_seconds": 100.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.46,
      "end_seconds": 106.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Let me think, I'd say two weeks, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 108.44,
      "end_seconds": 112.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I, I think it's been nearer three weeks, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.02,
      "end_seconds": 118.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly two to three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.55,
      "end_seconds": 122.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I, I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.42,
      "end_seconds": 131.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.5,
      "end_seconds": 145.92,
      "duration_seconds": 13.42,
      "text": "Well, um, I notice it more with gloves. Moisturiser helps a bit. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.55,
      "end_seconds": 154.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Ah, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 154.12,
      "end_seconds": 159.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "So, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.82,
      "end_seconds": 163.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 168.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.19,
      "end_seconds": 182.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.93,
      "text": "As for blisters between my fingers, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 183.43,
      "end_seconds": 185.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.12,
      "end_seconds": 188.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Any sign of fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.53,
      "end_seconds": 194.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.6,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Any oozing or nail changes at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.44,
      "end_seconds": 214.01,
      "duration_seconds": 13.57,
      "text": "No, no oozing, no nail changes. I did have dry flaky skin at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.89,
      "end_seconds": 220.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Any new soap or cream, rash elsewhere or joint pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.89,
      "end_seconds": 225.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Well, um, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.56,
      "end_seconds": 230.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.39,
      "end_seconds": 234.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "No, um, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.92,
      "end_seconds": 242.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.28,
      "end_seconds": 246.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Yeah, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.39,
      "end_seconds": 249.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.37,
      "end_seconds": 254.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.49,
      "end_seconds": 259.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.77,
      "end_seconds": 264.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.49,
      "end_seconds": 279.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.32,
      "end_seconds": 289.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "I mean, I've got eczema. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.69,
      "end_seconds": 292.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.5,
      "end_seconds": 312.22,
      "duration_seconds": 18.72,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes. Um, um, yes, high cholesterol. I just want to get back to normal, really. It's the not knowing that gets to me. Yes, heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.48,
      "end_seconds": 318.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Alright, eczema and high cholesterol, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.98,
      "end_seconds": 329.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.17,
      "end_seconds": 336.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "My son has asthma. Um, my brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.45,
      "end_seconds": 343.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.31,
      "end_seconds": 349.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Uh, uh, yes, grass pollen. I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.8,
      "end_seconds": 353.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.49,
      "end_seconds": 358.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Just my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.9,
      "end_seconds": 365.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.55,
      "end_seconds": 368.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.99,
      "end_seconds": 387.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "The skin on both hands is red, dry and cracked in the finger creases, with no weeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.12,
      "end_seconds": 407.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.48,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards irritant hand dermatitis. I can't rule out allergic contact dermatitis yet. I can't rule out a fungal skin infection yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.28,
      "end_seconds": 415.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Mm, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.73,
      "end_seconds": 435.98,
      "duration_seconds": 19.25,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now irritant hand dermatitis is my leading thought, not anything worse. Just to be sure I understood. You've had red, cracked skin on your hands, and no new soap or cream or oozing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 438.95,
      "end_seconds": 440.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.03,
      "end_seconds": 446.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a patch test for dermatitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 447.29,
      "end_seconds": 451.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 453.04,
      "end_seconds": 463.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Use gloves for washing up and moisturise straight after you dry your hands. Let's review you in three weeks. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 464.82,
      "end_seconds": 468.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}